<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Grinaker Construction yr shr, div rise.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Grinaker Construction yr shr, div rise.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	    81.2     vs    65.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)	12.0 making 18.0     vs    15.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income		 28.43     vs    22.95</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			 40.23     vs    34.40</p>
<p>    Tax			     12.36     vs    11.08</p>
<p>    Interest received	    8.17     vs    9.31</p>
<p>    Turnover		   1,914.50     vs    1,716.98</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     1.28 loss     vs    0.45</p>
<p>Div payable October 11</p>
<p>on register September 20</p>
<p>Full name: Grinaker Construction Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Grinaker Construction, a unit of Grinaker Holdings Ltd said it was planning to unbundle and have a separate listing under the control of Anglovaal Industries Ltd. Details would be published on September 17, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
